From 63f57f4f0bf90a1dae44055ff9ec225b97b38c9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:32:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: name ExpressiveOS in the build number toast, drop
 Evolution X legal

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: one of the build number toasts bragged
about Evolution X. The "Evolution X legal" title is no longer shown
anywhere (Legal information only lists LineageOS legal), so remove it
and its translations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
